<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/9/eng@/~cl_20> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 150 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: “(3) Any subsidiary legislation made under this Act may provide for any act or omission in contravention of the subsidiary legislation to be an offence and may provide for penalties of a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or of imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years, or both, and for a second or subsequent offence, of a fine not exceeding two hundred and fifty thousand ringgit or of imprisonment for a term not exceeding six years, or both.”. Savings"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/9/eng@> .
